    "All three actors know the shared roles, the prototype pump, the activation-safety question, and the public procedure before any delivery; this is the common ground used in the public summary.",
    "Ari is the authorized repairer and validator, as implied by the stated possibility of Ari performing repair and authorized revalidation.",
